<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Contact.Name},</span><br><br>Account: {!EBS_Order__c.Account_Name__c}</font><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Purchase Order:&nbsp;{!EBS_Order_Line__c.Purchase_Order__c}</font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sales Order:&nbsp;{!EBS_Order_Line__c.Sales_Order__c}</font></div><div><br></div><div><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US">This email confirms that one or more of your order lines have been verified as production ready, including artwork (if applicable) and has been released into our production queue.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">To view your order status and order details by line, use this link:&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b><u>{!EBS_Order__c.Tracking_Link_Formula__c}</u></b></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b><u><span lang="EN-US"><br></span></u></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US"><b>If the link doesn’t work, copy and paste above URL into your browser.</b></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span lang="EN-US">Should you have any questions about your order, please reply to this email.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></p></div><div><p style="font-family: &quot;source sans pro&quot;; font-size: medium;">All the best,<br>Anchor Wallace Customer Support</p></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>